{"id":"d5366face87e76fb","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-domination.md","title":"最终支配与逐点控制","display":"df-domination — 最终支配与逐点控制","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-domination","aliases":["43-df-domination"],"display":"df-domination — 最终支配与逐点控制","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.14, print p.57 / PDF p.77","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-domination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-domination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-domination — 最终支配与逐点控制"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.14, print p.57 / PDF p.77"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为总函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\le^*g\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge n_0\\Rightarrow f(n)\\le g(n)),\\qquad f\\le g\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(n)\\le g(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\le^*g\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge n_0\\Rightarrow f(n)\\le g(n)),\\qquad f\\le g\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(n)\\le g(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最终支配允许有限多个例外；对可计算支配函数，可增加有限常数将其转为逐点控制。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.14, print p.57 / PDF p.77。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\le^*g\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge n_0\\Rightarrow f(n)\\le g(n)),\\qquad f\\le g\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f(n)\\le g(n)).","display":true}],"bytes":927,"backlinks":[{"id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-domination]] — 最终支配与逐点控制"},{"id":"a09ec8a13786db93","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $|A|=\\infty$。$p_A$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$、$\\le^*$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-principal-function]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]、[[43-df-domination]]、[[43-df-computable]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}